                    <code>disabled</code>
                  </td>
                  <td>An action that is not available yet</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <h2>States</h2>
          <p>
            Secondary, standard icon and ghost icon buttons keep their resting
            fill on hover and show a 4px ring.
          </p>
          <div class="state-grid">
            {states.map((state) => (
              <div class="state-cell">
                <>
                  <span>{state}</span>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="btn-primary"
                    data-preview-state={state.toLowerCase()}
                    disabled={state === "Disabled"}
                    aria-busy={state === "Loading"}
                  >
                    {state === "Loading" ? "Saving…" : "Save changes"}
                  </button>
                </>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <section
          id="button-group"
          class="ds-topic"
          data-component="button-group"
        >
          <h1 tabindex="-1">Button group</h1>
          <p class="ds-lead">
            Related buttons, links or a menu joined into one control. Name the
            group when its purpose is not clear from the buttons.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <ButtonGroup label="Payment actions">
              <a class="btn-secondary" href="#button-group">
                Account ledger
              </a>
              <a class="btn-primary" href="#button-group">
                Import bank statement
              </a>
            </ButtonGroup>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<ButtonGroup label="Payment actions">\n  <a class="btn-secondary" href="…">Account ledger</a>\n  <a class="btn-primary" href="…">Import bank statement</a>\n</ButtonGroup>`}</code></pre>
        </section>

        <section id="checkbox" class="ds-topic" data-component="checkbox">
          <h1 tabindex="-1">Checkbox and radio</h1>
          <p class="ds-lead">
            Checkboxes pick any number of options; radios pick exactly one, with
            the usual choice already selected. The label sits beside the box and
            the whole row toggles it.
          </p>
          <h2>Checkbox states</h2>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <div class="check-list" role="group" aria-label="Checkbox states">
              <label class="check-row">
                <input type="checkbox" name="specimen-check-off" /> Email the
                invoice
              </label>
              <label class="check-row">
                <input type="checkbox" name="specimen-check-on" checked /> Print
                a paper copy
              </label>
              <label class="check-row">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="specimen-check-mixed"
                  data-indeterminate
                />
                Some dwellings selected
              </label>
              <label class="check-row">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="specimen-check-disabled"
                  disabled
                />
                Send by post
              </label>
              <label class="check-row">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="specimen-check-locked"
                  checked
                  disabled
                />
                Keep a copy in the archive
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<label class="check-row">\n  <input type="checkbox" name="email" /> Email the invoice\n</label>`}</code></pre>
          <h2>Radio group</h2>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <fieldset class="check-list">
              <legend class="field-label">Delivery</legend>
              <label class="check-row">
                <input type="radio" name="specimen-delivery" checked /> Email
              </label>
              <label class="check-row">
                <input type="radio" name="specimen-delivery" /> Paper
              </label>
              <label class="check-row">
                <input type="radio" name="specimen-delivery" disabled /> Portal
                only
              </label>
            </fieldset>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<fieldset>\n  <legend class="field-label">Delivery</legend>\n  <label class="check-row">\n    <input type="radio" name="delivery" checked /> Email\n  </label>\n  …\n</fieldset>`}</code></pre>
        </section>

        <section id="disclosure" class="ds-topic" data-component="disclosure">
          <h1 tabindex="-1">Disclosure</h1>
          <p class="ds-lead">
            Native details and summary, for detail that most readers can skip.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <details class="disclosure">
              <summary>Why is this invoice blocked?</summary>
              <p class="text-body-sm text-muted">
                The billing email is missing. Add it to the dwelling record,
                then prepare the invoice again.
              </p>
            </details>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<details class="disclosure">\n  <summary>Why is this invoice blocked?</summary>\n  <p>…</p>\n</details>`}</code></pre>
        </section>

        <section id="dropdown" class="ds-topic" data-component="dropdown">
          <h1 tabindex="-1">Dropdown</h1>
          <p class="ds-lead">
            A list of actions or choices that opens from a button. It closes on
            a pick, an outside click or Escape. Destructive items come last.
          </p>
          <h2>Dropdown</h2>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <details class="dropdown" data-dismiss>
              <summary class="btn-secondary">
                Export
                <Icon name="chevron-right" size="xs" class="dropdown-chevron" />
              </summary>
              <div class="dropdown-panel">
                <a class="dropdown-item" href="#dropdown">
                  <Icon name="download" size="sm" />
                  Invoices as PDF
                </a>
                <a class="dropdown-item" href="#dropdown">
                  <Icon name="download" size="sm" />
                  Ledger as CSV
                </a>
                <hr class="dropdown-divider" />
                <a class="dropdown-item" href="#dropdown">
                  <Icon name="file-description" size="sm" />
                  <span>
                    Bank statement
                    <span class="dropdown-item-note">ISO 20022 camt.053</span>
                  </span>
                </a>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="dropdown-item dropdown-item-danger"
                >
                  <Icon name="trash" size="sm" />
                  Clear export history
                </button>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{dropdownSnippet}</code></pre>
          <h2>Dropdown menu</h2>
          <p>
            When a dropdown is more than a list: quick actions as tiles, then
            labelled groups of menu items. The organization switcher is one.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <details class="dropdown" data-dismiss>
              <summary class="btn-primary">
                Period actions
                <Icon name="chevron-right" size="xs" class="dropdown-chevron" />
              </summary>
              <nav class="dropdown-panel" aria-label="Period actions">
                <div class="dropdown-tiles">
                  <a class="dropdown-tile" href="#dropdown">
                    <Icon name="lock" />
                    Lock period
                  </a>
                  <a class="dropdown-tile" href="#dropdown">
                    <Icon name="send" />
                    Send invoices
                  </a>
                </div>
                <p class="menu-label" id="specimen-other-actions">
                  Other actions
                </p>
                <ul class="menu-list" aria-labelledby="specimen-other-actions">
                  <li>
                    <a href="#dropdown">
                      <Icon name="circle-check" size="sm" />
                      Check readings
                    </a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <a href="#dropdown">
                      <Icon name="archive" size="sm" />
                      Archive period
                    </a>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </nav>
            </details>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{dropdownMenuSnippet}</code></pre>
        </section>

        <section id="empty-state" class="ds-topic" data-component="empty-state">
          <h1 tabindex="-1">Empty state</h1>
          <p class="ds-lead">
            Shown when a list or page has nothing in it yet. It says what is
            missing and offers the next action.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <EmptyState
              title="No billing periods yet"
              description="Create the first period to start collecting readings."
              ornament
            >
              <button type="button" class="btn-secondary">
                Create period
              </button>
            </EmptyState>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<EmptyState title="No billing periods yet" description="…" ornament>\n  <button class="btn-secondary">Create period</button>\n</EmptyState>`}</code></pre>
        </section>

        <section id="form-field" class="ds-topic" data-component="form-field">
          <div class="ds-topic-head">
            <h1 tabindex="-1">Form field</h1>
            <button class="copy-button" type="button" data-copy={emailSnippet}>
              Copy snippet
            </button>
          </div>
          <p class="ds-lead">
            Every control has a visible label. Text fields and selects put it
            above, with an optional hint or error below, linked by{" "}
            <code>aria-describedby</code>. Checkboxes and switches put it
            beside.
          </p>
          <h2>Text, select, checkbox and error</h2>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div>
                <label class="field-label" for="specimen-email">
                  Billing email
                </label>
                <input
                  id="specimen-email"
                  name="specimen-email"
                  type="email"
                  autocomplete="email"
                  spellcheck="false"
                  placeholder="name@example.com"
                  aria-describedby="specimen-email-hint"
                  class="mt-1"
                />
                <p id="specimen-email-hint" class="field-hint">
                  Invoices are sent here.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="field-label" for="specimen-cycle">
                  Billing cycle
                </label>
                <select id="specimen-cycle" name="cycle" class="mt-1">
                  <option>Monthly</option>
                  <option>Quarterly</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <label class="check-row">
                <input type="checkbox" name="reminders" checked /> Send
                reminders
              </label>
              <div>
                <label class="field-label" for="specimen-reference">
                  Invoice reference
                </label>
                <input
                  id="specimen-reference"
                  class="mt-1"
                  name="reference"
                  aria-invalid="true"
                  aria-describedby="specimen-reference-error"
                  value="PB-"
                />
                <p id="specimen-reference-error" class="field-error">
                  Use a complete invoice reference.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{emailSnippet}</code></pre>
          <h2>Boxed field</h2>
          <p>
            The label sits inside the frame, over the control, and the frame
            takes the field's state; a hint or error goes under the frame. Mark
            the optional fields; give a field that must not be missed{" "}
            <code>is-required</code> (a red dot by its label) as well as the{" "}
            <code>required</code> attribute.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="field-box">
                <label for="specimen-box-phone">
                  Phone <span class="field-optional">· optional</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  id="specimen-box-phone"
                  name="specimen-box-phone"
                  type="tel"
                  autocomplete="tel"
                  placeholder="+371 2000 0000"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="field-box is-required">
                <label for="specimen-box-owner">Owner's name</label>
                <input
                  id="specimen-box-owner"
                  name="specimen-box-owner"
                  autocomplete="name"
                  required
                />
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="field-box is-required">
                  <label for="specimen-box-area">Floor area</label>
                  <input
                    id="specimen-box-area"
                    name="specimen-box-area"
                    inputmode="decimal"
                    data-tone="warning"
                    aria-describedby="specimen-box-area-hint"
                    required
                  />
                </div>
                <p id="specimen-box-area-hint" class="field-hint">
                  Needed to split the heating bill.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="field-box">
                  <label for="specimen-box-iban">IBAN</label>
                  <input
                    id="specimen-box-iban"
                    name="specimen-box-iban"
                    value="LV80 BANK 0000"
                    aria-invalid="true"
                    aria-describedby="specimen-box-iban-error"
                  />
                </div>
                <p id="specimen-box-iban-error" class="field-error">
                  The IBAN is too short.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{boxedSnippet}</code></pre>
          <h2>Compact form</h2>
          <p>
            Boxed fields that belong together share one frame. Two columns from
            640px; <code>--cols</code> sets more and <code>field-span</code>{" "}
            takes a whole row.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <div class="field-group" role="group" aria-label="Resident">
              <div class="field-box is-required">
                <label for="specimen-compact-name">Full name</label>
                <input
                  id="specimen-compact-name"
                  name="specimen-compact-name"
                  autocomplete="name"
                  required
                />
              </div>
              <div class="field-box">
                <label for="specimen-compact-flat">Dwelling</label>
                <select id="specimen-compact-flat" name="specimen-compact-flat">
                  <option>12</option>
                  <option>14</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field-box field-span">
                <label for="specimen-compact-email">Billing email</label>
                <input
                  id="specimen-compact-email"
                  name="specimen-compact-email"
                  type="email"
                  autocomplete="email"
                  spellcheck="false"
                  value="anna@"
                  aria-invalid="true"
                  aria-describedby="specimen-compact-email-error"
                />
              </div>
              <label class="check-row field-span">
                <input type="checkbox" name="specimen-compact-paper" /> Also
                send a paper copy
              </label>
            </div>
            <p id="specimen-compact-email-error" class="field-error">
              Billing email: add the part after the @.
            </p>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{compactSnippet}</code></pre>
          <h2>Icons and colour grading</h2>
          <p>
            A leading icon says what goes in; a trailing one shows the state.
            Errors (<code>aria-invalid</code>) and <code>data-tone</code>{" "}
            warning or success tint the border and the fill.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div>
                <label class="field-label" for="specimen-search">
                  Find a dwelling
                </label>
                <div class="input-icon mt-1">
                  <Icon name="search" size="sm" />
                  <input
                    id="specimen-search"
                    name="specimen-search"
                    type="search"
                    placeholder="Number or owner"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="field-label" for="specimen-reading">
                  Meter reading
                </label>
                <div class="input-icon mt-1">
                  <input
                    id="specimen-reading"
                    name="specimen-reading"
                    inputmode="decimal"
                    value="1 204.5"
                    data-tone="warning"
                    aria-describedby="specimen-reading-note"
                  />
                  <Icon
                    name="alert-triangle"
                    size="sm"
                    class="input-icon-end"
                  />
                </div>
                <p id="specimen-reading-note" class="field-hint">
                  Lower than last month's 1 310.0. Check the meter.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="field-label" for="specimen-saved">
                  Bank reference
                </label>
                <div class="input-icon mt-1">
                  <input
                    id="specimen-saved"
                    name="specimen-saved"
                    value="RF18 5390 0754 7034"
                    data-tone="success"
                    aria-describedby="specimen-saved-note"
                  />
                  <Icon name="circle-check" size="sm" class="input-icon-end" />
                </div>
                <p id="specimen-saved-note" class="field-hint">
                  Saved.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{iconFieldSnippet}</code></pre>
          <h2>Switch</h2>
          <div class="ds-specimen">
            <div
              class="component-row toggle-specimen"
              role="group"
              aria-label="Switch states"
            >
              <label class="check-row">
                <span class="toggle-switch">
                  <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    role="switch"
                    name="specimen-switch-off"
                  />
                  <span class="toggle-switch-track" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="toggle-switch-thumb"></span>
                  </span>
                </span>
                Automatic reminders
              </label>
              <label class="check-row">
                <span class="toggle-switch">
                  <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    role="switch"
                    name="specimen-switch-on"
                    checked
                  />
                  <span class="toggle-switch-track" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="toggle-switch-thumb"></span>
                  </span>
                </span>
                Auto-generate invoices
              </label>
              <label class="check-row">
                <span class="toggle-switch">
                  <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    role="switch"
                    name="specimen-switch-disabled"
                    checked
                    disabled
                  />
                  <span class="toggle-switch-track" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="toggle-switch-thumb"></span>
                  </span>
                </span>
                Locked billing option
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<label class="check-row">\n  <span class="toggle-switch">\n    <input type="checkbox" role="switch" name="reminders" />\n    <span class="toggle-switch-track" aria-hidden="true">\n      <span class="toggle-switch-thumb"></span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n  Automatic reminders\n</label>`}</code></pre>
        </section>

        <section id="kpi-card" class="ds-topic" data-component="kpi-card">
          <h1 tabindex="-1">KPI card</h1>
          <p class="ds-lead">
            Standalone summary figures with <code>KpiCard</code>, and the
            dashboard&apos;s collection breakdown card with its companion
            invoice ledger. For uniform inline rows of figures, use a metric
            strip.
          </p>
          <h2>Single KPI card</h2>
          <p>
            Used on views such as Periods where individual totals sit side by
            side without an embedded breakdown.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen kpi-grid">
            <KpiCard
              label="Collected"
              value="€48,920"
              tone="success"
              icon="coins"
            />
            <KpiCard label="Due soon" value="14" tone="warning" icon="clock" />
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<KpiCard label="Collected" value="€48,920" tone="success" icon="coins" />`}</code></pre>
          <h2>Icon tile</h2>
          <p>
            The KPI card&apos;s icon square, shared by settings cards, summaries
            and drawer rows. <code>icon-tile-sm</code> is 32px; tone it with
            <code>data-tone</code>.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen ds-inline">
            <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true">
              <Icon name="building" />
            </span>
            <span class="icon-tile" data-tone="info" aria-hidden="true">
              <Icon name="info-circle" />
            </span>
            <span class="icon-tile" data-tone="success" aria-hidden="true">
              <Icon name="check" />
            </span>
            <span class="icon-tile icon-tile-sm" aria-hidden="true">
              <Icon name="coin" />
            </span>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<span class="icon-tile" data-tone="info" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="info-circle" /></span>`}</code></pre>
          <h2>Collection and money breakdown</h2>
          <p>
            Used on the main admin dashboard: collection progress and exception
            totals sit on the left beside an accounting breakdown on the right.
            Below <code>32rem</code> of container width, the breakdown collapses
            into a disclosure via <code>initCollectionLedgers()</code>. Give the
            disclosure a stable ID so it retains its state after a refresh.
          </p>
          <div class="ds-specimen dashboard-metrics">
            <div
              class="dashboard-metric collection-card panel"
              data-metric="collection"
            >
              <div class="collection-grid">
                <div class="collection-summary">
                  <span class="metric-label" id="specimen-collection-label">
                    Paid on invoices
                  </span>
                  <div class="collection-hero">
                    <a
                      class="collection-link"
                      aria-labelledby="specimen-collection-label specimen-collection-received"
                      href="#kpi-card"
                    >
                      <strong
                        class="collection-received"
                        id="specimen-collection-received"
                      >
                        3 110.00 €
                      </strong>
                    </a>
                    <span class="collection-share">73.7%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div
                    class="collection-bar"
                    role="img"
                    aria-label="73.7% of 4 218.40 € paid"
                  >
                    <span style="width: 73.7%"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="collection-split">
                    <div class="collection-row">
                      <span>Total to pay</span>
                      <strong class="collection-total">4 218.40 €</strong>
                    </div>
                    <a
                      class="collection-row"
                      data-metric="unpaid"
                      href="#kpi-card"
                    >
                      <span class="collection-row-label">Still unpaid</span>
                      <strong>1 108.40 €</strong>
                    </a>
                    <a
                      class="collection-row"
                      data-metric="overdue"
                      data-tone="danger"
                      href="#kpi-card"
                    >
                      <span>
                        <Icon name="alert-triangle" size="xs" />
                        <span class="collection-row-label">
                          Overdue payments
                        </span>
                        <span class="collection-share">2</span>
                      </span>
                      <strong>342.10 €</strong>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <details
                  id="specimen-collection-ledger"
                  class="collection-ledger"
                  open
                >
                  <summary class="chevron-toggle chevron-toggle-end">
                    Invoice breakdown
                  </summary>
                  <dl class="money-ledger" aria-label="Money this month">
                    <div>
                      <dt>
                        <span class="money-operator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <span>This month&apos;s invoices</span>
                      </dt>
                      <dd>3 902.10 €</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <dt>
                        <span class="money-operator" aria-hidden="true">
                          +
                        </span>
                        <span>Previous debt</span>
                      </dt>
                      <dd>410.00 €</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <dt>
                        <span class="money-operator" aria-hidden="true">
                          −
                        </span>
                        <span>Previous overpayment</span>
                      </dt>
                      <dd>125.00 €</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <dt>
                        <span class="money-operator" aria-hidden="true">
                          +
                        </span>
                        <span>Late fees</span>
                      </dt>
                      <dd>31.30 €</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div class="money-total">
                      <dt>
                        <span class="money-operator" aria-hidden="true">
                          =
                        </span>
                        <span>Total to pay</span>
                      </dt>
                      <dd>4 218.40 €</dd>
                    </div>
                  </dl>
                  <p class="collection-note">
                    Includes invoices that are not sent yet.
                  </p>
                </details>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <pre class="ds-code"><code>{`<div class="dashboard-metric collection-card panel" data-metric="collection">
  <div class="collection-grid">
    <div class="collection-summary">…</div>
    <details id="collection-ledger" class="collection-ledger" open>
      <summary class="chevron-toggle chevron-toggle-end">Invoice breakdown</summary>
      <dl class="money-ledger">…</dl>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>`}</code></pre>
          <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="specimen-dashboard-attention">
            <div class="dashboard-section-heading">
              <div>
                <h2 id="specimen-dashboard-attention">Needs attention</h2>
                <p aria-label="2 cases">2</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="divide-y divide-border">
              <li class="px-6 py-3">Dwelling 12 · Missing meter readings</li>
              <li class="px-6 py-3">Dwelling 14 · Billing email missing</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
        </section>

        <section id="link" class="ds-topic" data-component="link">
          <h1 tabindex="-1">Link</h1>
          <p class="ds-lead">
            For moving somewhere, or an action that is not the main one. Inside
            running text use an underlined link so it does not rely on colour.
          </p>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="ds-spec">
              <caption class="sr-only">Link variants</caption>
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="col">Example</th>
                  <th scope="col">Code</th>
                  <th scope="col">Use</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {links.map(([className, use]) => (
