          <h2>Quiet status text</h2>
          <p>
            High-density worklists such as Current Month use{" "}
            <code>.status-text</code> for routine stages so tinted badges mark
            only exceptions (<code>MISSING_DATA</code> and <code>OVERDUE</code>
            ).
